# agent sprite pool: regi
# braille dot eyes in a round box (style 06 of the 1st test set) + variants: dot pattern, frame. frames: thin solid or dotted lines, same width. 0 single vertical line on the top or bottom border, 0 open corners.
# format: id line, then 4 rows of 7 cells, blank line between sprites.


